# Excluded from remote (per project policy)
README.md
# ...but the bare rule above matches at any depth. data/README.md documents the
# canonical packet data and its generator, and must ship (plan 107).
!/data/README.md
# Was a bare `native/`, which matches a directory of that name at ANY depth —
# so it swallowed src/native/ as well, keeping src/native/injector.ts out of
# the repo entirely. A fresh clone then failed to bundle: DevServer.ts imports
# ../../native/injector.js and esbuild could not resolve it. Ignore only what
# scripts/build-native.mjs actually generates.
/electron/native/build/
/src/native/hello-event.js
/src/native/rotmg-shared.js
assets/internal.bin
assets/internal.dll
assets/version.dll
